Adds complete casino game suite including roulette with full betting options and four card games (blackjack, poker, baccarat, war).

## Casino Games (Non-Card)

- **Roulette**: American roulette with straight numbers (35:1), colors (1:1), dozens/columns (2:1), and high/low bets
- **Slots**: 7-symbol slot machine with weighted probabilities and jackpot (777x)
- **Dice**: Craps with 10+ bet types including snake eyes (30:1), boxcars (30:1), naturals (7:1)

## Card Games

- **Blackjack**: Standard 21 with dealer AI (hits to 17), blackjack detection (3:2 payout)
- **Poker**: 5-card draw with full hand ranking (Royal Flush to High Card)
- **Baccarat**: Player/Banker/Tie betting with proper third card drawing rules per casino standards
- **War**: High card comparison with war mechanic on ties (2:1 payout)

## Implementation

All commands follow existing patterns:

```javascript
export async function handle(interaction, env, ctx) {
  // Game logic
  const result = playGame(options);

  // Return Discord embed
  return {
    type: 4,
    data: {
      embeds: [{
        title: '🎰 Game Name',
        fields: [/* results */]
      }]
    }
  };
}
```

Files created: `roulette.js`, `slots.js`, `dice.js`, `blackjack.js`, `poker.js`, `baccarat.js`, `war.js`  
Modified: `commands/index.js` to register all handlers

